WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.760
Not very long ago, Rod Dreher, from "The

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:03.120
American Conservative",

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:07.318
as well as a few other media outlets,
published a comment on

00:00:07.318 --> 00:00:10.000
an article, on a scholarly
article, that talked about

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.480
creating a human-monkey
hybrid in an embryo form;

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:19.600
and they talk about how they did it - you
know the case -

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:24.800
and they even use the word "chimera",
which is the ancient word they used to

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.839
talk about these
mythical monsters that were a mixture

00:00:27.839 --> 00:00:32.799
between different types
of beings. I want to look at this

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:36.000
together with you,
not for the shock value, not just because

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.238
it's strange and it's odd, but because
the symbolism that I talk about - there's

00:00:40.238 --> 00:00:43.520
something objective about it -; and
when I talk about

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:46.558
being attentive to the signs, the signs
of the end of

00:00:46.558 --> 00:00:49.600
something, the signs of the end
of a story,

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:54.000
these are objective, and they will
manifest themselves.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.079
There are different ways that that can
happen, but they will happen; symbolism

00:00:58.079 --> 00:01:02.238
really does happen, and this is
particularly a case, a sign of the times,

00:01:02.238 --> 00:01:13.840
to help us see where we are in the story.

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:26.719
(Opening) This is Jonathan Pageau, welcome
to "The Symbolic World".

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:32.640
In the ancient world - in the story
of Noah, and the flood, and the traditions

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:36.560
surrounding that especially -
there is this idea that before the flood,

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:40.719
or before the end of a world,
there was a moment where there were

00:01:40.719 --> 00:01:44.078
hybrids, where there's a mixture between
the sons of God

00:01:44.078 --> 00:01:48.799
and the daughters of men. There are
different interpretations of this:

00:01:48.799 --> 00:01:52.319
there are interpretations on which we talk about
the lineage of Cain mixing

00:01:52.319 --> 00:01:56.399
with the lineage of Seth, and there are
also interpretations that talk about

00:01:56.399 --> 00:01:59.200
how angels, fallen angels,
would have relationships

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:04.879
with humans; but for our
particular understanding, it doesn't

00:02:04.879 --> 00:02:07.920
matter that much which
interpretation you follow, or if you even

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:11.759
follow both interpretations:
it's most important to understand that

00:02:11.759 --> 00:02:17.120
one of the aspects of the end of a world
is hybridity - and this is not just

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:20.239
something that
you describe, but it is in

00:02:20.239 --> 00:02:23.598
the very meaning of
what it means for something to

00:02:23.598 --> 00:02:27.120
reach its end.
I've talked about this many times before,

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:31.039
but here we really have an example
of a sign of the time that is helping us

00:02:31.039 --> 00:02:34.639
understand
where we are, and how the possibilities

00:02:34.639 --> 00:02:38.080
of a world
will actually manifest the shape of

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:43.039
reality.
The shape of reality is,

00:02:43.039 --> 00:02:46.959
the notion of identity is based
on the idea that there is

00:02:46.959 --> 00:02:50.318
something which is "one" - whether it's
a person, whether it's

00:02:50.318 --> 00:02:53.680
a nation, whether it's a community,
whatever it is -,

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:57.759
there's a manner in which we are capable
of seeing "the unity";

00:02:57.759 --> 00:03:01.598
and this unity has a coherence: there's
something which binds us together,

00:03:01.598 --> 00:03:05.598
something in common - we have something in
common which binds us together -,

00:03:05.598 --> 00:03:09.439
and as you move away from the most
common, or the

00:03:09.439 --> 00:03:14.000
elements that have the most in common,
it lays itself out as

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:17.439
a hierarchy; and as
you move away from that,

00:03:17.439 --> 00:03:22.318
you reach certain idiosyncrasies,
and then, ultimately,

00:03:22.318 --> 00:03:26.318
you reach the buffer between that
identity and other identities -

00:03:26.318 --> 00:03:32.560
and that buffer is a place of hybrids.
This can be true almost

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:35.439
of any category,
and sometimes they don't

00:03:35.439 --> 00:03:39.680
necessarily manifest,
but you can imagine for example:

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:42.799
the modern world has
actually been extremely good

00:03:42.799 --> 00:03:48.318
at trying to create these
hybrid type of objects,

00:03:48.318 --> 00:03:51.919
hybrid objects, where something
is a flashlight and a

00:03:51.919 --> 00:03:55.438
pen at the same time - it's
different things at the same time -;

00:03:55.438 --> 00:03:58.239
it's two different identities
that we can recognize that are kind of

00:03:58.239 --> 00:04:01.519
jammed into one identity,
and this is what

00:04:01.519 --> 00:04:03.680
happens in the buffer of the world;
and it laid itself

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:07.120
out in the ancient
cosmologies, where in

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:10.158
the middle you would
have some founder,

00:04:10.158 --> 00:04:13.199
some god,

00:04:13.199 --> 00:04:17.439
some central figure that is the one
that we all looked toward to, that

00:04:17.439 --> 00:04:20.160
brought down the law - for example in the
case of Moses, that

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:23.918
brought kingship, that
brought unity, somehow -;

00:04:23.918 --> 00:04:27.439
and then, as you move away
from that person,

00:04:27.439 --> 00:04:30.478
you come to the edge, where it's the
place where you're in a

00:04:30.478 --> 00:04:33.600
border with what is foreign
to you - imagine

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:37.600
different countries,
different empires, and on the border

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:40.800
between different countries you
will necessarily have

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:44.319
hybridity, you'll have a mixture:
if you live on the border

00:04:44.319 --> 00:04:47.040
between two countries,
there you'll have people that intermarry

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:50.399
between the two identities, as it's
just going to happen naturally -;

00:04:50.399 --> 00:04:56.160
and there's a function for
that: it acts as a

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:59.360
buffer zone to
create a little bit of

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:03.759
space between two identities,
where it isn't just a

00:05:03.759 --> 00:05:06.639
complete shutting off,
or complete cutting off:

00:05:06.639 --> 00:05:09.600
it's like a breathing space,
where you can actually get potential

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:13.519
from the other identity;
and so there's a kind of

00:05:13.519 --> 00:05:16.560
a certain openness on the border -
but it's on the border, it's not

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:19.759
happening in the center.
When I say that, a lot of people will all

00:05:19.759 --> 00:05:22.160
the sudden be suspicious,
because they're noticing

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:28.720
how the narrative of hybridity is taking
over the world. We value hybridity,

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:32.639
we value the idea
of mixture in

00:05:32.639 --> 00:05:35.439
so many domains -
whether it is in terms of culture,

00:05:35.439 --> 00:05:38.000
the idea that
we want to have all these different

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.720
restaurants, and different kinds of foods
with different kinds of identities -,

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:44.079
all of this is something that we value;
usually, that reality

00:05:44.079 --> 00:05:48.478
is, like I said, on the border, but now we
are pretty much embodying it in

00:05:48.478 --> 00:05:52.720
all of our culture,
and, just like in the time of the flood,

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:55.839
this was necessarily
going to move into

00:05:55.839 --> 00:06:00.720
extremes.
We've already seen a form of "chimera"

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:05.439
in the past: the idea that
they're injecting genes of animals into

00:06:05.439 --> 00:06:10.560
fruits or vegetables, the idea that
they're using different genes from

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:14.000
certain animals - everybody probably
saw the glow in the dark pigs

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:17.199
that they created
by using certain genes from

00:06:17.199 --> 00:06:20.639
phosphorus animals,
and then putting in them into the pigs -;

00:06:20.639 --> 00:06:26.240
we're already seeing
little versions of "chimera".

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:30.079
You've probably seen these weird images
of people growing

00:06:30.079 --> 00:06:34.240
ears on rats and
all this kind of strange stuff that is

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:37.680
happening;
so, it was inevitable that

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:40.959
it would come to
the actual creation of a chimera:

00:06:40.959 --> 00:06:43.519
just like as the
world lays itself out on the edge

00:06:43.519 --> 00:06:46.839
of the world there are monsters, there
are things that don't fit

00:06:46.839 --> 00:06:51.120
into categories;
as we value the monstrous,

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:55.680
the exception, the hybridity,
it was necessarily going to happen -

00:06:55.680 --> 00:07:02.160
as a sign of the times -
that we would actually go towards

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:07.038
hybridity itself, in terms of
human-animal hybridity.

00:07:07.038 --> 00:07:09.439
You can see it almost as a
"layer lower": you can

00:07:09.439 --> 00:07:11.680
imagine the first cycle
before the flood as being

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:15.598
kind of higher, where we have the
higher beings mixing with

00:07:15.598 --> 00:07:19.598
the lower beings, and then once again you
have higher beings mixing with lower

00:07:19.598 --> 00:07:22.478
beings but at a lower level -
where instead of

00:07:22.478 --> 00:07:26.160
having gods mixing with
humans, or angels mixing

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:29.839
with humans, like you see
in the great greek myth for example,

00:07:29.839 --> 00:07:33.360
now you have the lower being, which is
more like the minotaur

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:38.639
version of hybridity, which is the
the woman mixing with

00:07:38.639 --> 00:07:41.918
the bull in the
myth - and then you see that

00:07:41.918 --> 00:07:44.319
right now with the idea of creating
the hybrids.

00:07:44.319 --> 00:07:48.000
This problem of creating hybrids
and creating monsters

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:53.598
is, of course, very much
the problem of a

00:07:53.598 --> 00:07:58.079
labyrinth. It is the problem where
identity starts to fracture and it

00:07:58.079 --> 00:08:03.519
starts to break down,
and it brings about a lot of chaos; but

00:08:03.519 --> 00:08:07.120
it's also going to bring about
other strange things as well, and people

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:12.000
are already talking about how
the danger of doing that is

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:16.079
creating a lower
form of being that

00:08:16.079 --> 00:08:21.598
will somehow be akin to you, but not
completely. So, you can imagine the

00:08:21.598 --> 00:08:24.720
creation of orcs or these monsters out
of the ground:

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:28.399
this is what is actually happening;
and people will

00:08:28.399 --> 00:08:32.080
say: "well, it's just an
embryo", "it's just a fetus",

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:36.320
"it's not a complete person". First of all,
the fact that they're telling this

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:41.278
publicly means that they've done a lot
of other things in private before

00:08:41.278 --> 00:08:44.320
letting this out publicly, so there might
be things out there

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:49.039
that we're not aware of -
because if they're willing to

00:08:49.039 --> 00:08:51.919
show this to us in public,
then there are other things going on as

00:08:51.919 --> 00:08:56.639
well - and the narrative
will play itself out.

00:08:56.639 --> 00:09:00.000
This is one of the things that
I try to bring up: once you

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:05.440
start a certain series of events,
once you engage in a story, then that

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.919
story is going
to play itself out; the

00:09:07.919 --> 00:09:10.799
characters might change,
the people who embody the characters

00:09:10.799 --> 00:09:13.440
might change - so, yes, this scientist
that did, that maybe

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.320
made the the monkey-human

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:20.080
embryo, will not be
281
necessarily the one to go

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:23.120
all the way
and bring this being into the world, in

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:27.360
terms of being born -;
that doesn't matter,

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:30.639
because you've opened up
a space and then someone else is going

00:09:30.639 --> 00:09:33.919
to go into that space,
and then when you open up that space,

00:09:33.919 --> 00:09:36.559
then someone else is going to go into
the other space:

00:09:36.559 --> 00:09:42.000
once you create
a possibility, someone will come and

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:47.519
inhabit that possibility.
I just wanted to help

00:09:47.519 --> 00:09:51.200
you see that, when I talk about
the shape of the world, and this

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:53.440
idea that on the
edge of the world are these

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:56.320
monsters, and are these exceptions, and
all this weird stuff,

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:59.759
and when I told you that we're going to
see things that we haven't seen in

00:09:59.759 --> 00:10:02.799
thousands of years,
this is already something that is on the

00:10:02.799 --> 00:10:07.519
horizon and that
is appearing; that is: the

00:10:07.519 --> 00:10:10.639
old mythological image of a
chimera, the one that

00:10:10.639 --> 00:10:14.559
all the rationalists
thought were just their imagination,

00:10:14.559 --> 00:10:17.759
were just this stupid thing that they
imagined - that there were these beings

00:10:17.759 --> 00:10:20.240
that were a mixture
of different identities,

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:23.360
and different centaurs
and ciders, and all

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:29.120
of these human-hybrid characters -
they'll actually

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:32.320
manifest; they might not look
the way that they're represented in

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:36.159
mythological storytelling,
but they're going to exist in the

00:10:36.159 --> 00:10:40.958
world - because that's where we are,
and symbolism happens. I just wanted

00:10:40.958 --> 00:10:44.639
to put that out a little bit,
I didn't want to insist on it too much,

00:10:44.639 --> 00:10:48.799
but I just wanted to
point people to the fact that this is

00:10:48.799 --> 00:10:52.399
a serious thing:
this question of how symbolic

00:10:52.399 --> 00:10:55.600
structures happen
and lay themselves out, they're not just

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:59.039
allegorical - they really
do get embodied in the world -;

00:10:59.039 --> 00:11:03.120
so we have to be careful.
We have to be careful of the things that

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:06.078
we put out in the world - we're not in
control of what's being put out

00:11:06.078 --> 00:11:09.440
in the world, sadly -,
but it can also help you see

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:13.278
that if we put out
real stories into the world, if we put

00:11:13.278 --> 00:11:16.320
out the versions
of the real story into the

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:20.000
world, then that will
also create a possibility that will be

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:24.480
inhabited. So, as
this entire world is going

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:28.879
towards the "fallen angel",
"AI" and hybrid

00:11:28.879 --> 00:11:36.000
human-animal "thing",
realize that this is a sign of the

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:39.679
times, not arbitrary
at all, but completely coherent

00:11:39.679 --> 00:11:42.559
with the way the world actually lays
itself out - and for those who are

00:11:42.559 --> 00:11:45.839
attentive, we can
understand what is happening, and

00:11:45.839 --> 00:11:51.278
hopefully try to be
an antidote, through telling

00:11:51.278 --> 00:11:53.839
better stories,
being part of better stories,

00:11:53.839 --> 00:11:57.039
participating in the
real world. So, thank you for

00:11:57.039 --> 00:11:59.440
your attention, everybody. Thank you
for your support

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:02.879
with everything that's been going on.
In the last few

00:12:02.879 --> 00:12:06.240
weeks after the Jordan
Peterson discussion,

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:10.000
I've been putting out less videos: I was
kind of overwhelmed by a wave

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.679
of all kinds of questions, and attentions
and interviews - some of them you might

00:12:13.679 --> 00:12:16.639
not have seen, the
requests for writing articles and

00:12:16.639 --> 00:12:19.360
requests for all this stuff -,
so I'm just kind of "surfing this

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:22.799
wave";  but I've got a lot of videos
coming very soon.

00:12:22.799 --> 00:12:28.078
I ended up recording the
whole kind of weird satanic "Lil

00:12:28.078 --> 00:12:31.839
Nas X" video, and
I've got several discussions on the

00:12:31.839 --> 00:12:35.440
line as well,
including with Vodolazkin, who

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:38.480
wrote the novel "Laurus" -
I'm extremely excited

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:42.240
to have a chance to
interview him, because he also has

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:44.958
this intuition that
we're at a transition mode, and

00:12:44.958 --> 00:12:48.559
that we're entering,
or that we're closer to a world that will be

00:12:48.559 --> 00:12:53.839
re-enchanted once again. So thanks, again.
I'll talk to you soon.

